        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo BLP-210, Outswing Door Security Latch Guard Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis steel security door latch protector is 10\" high and designed specifically for outswing doors (door opens out of the room or building). For use with key-in knobs / levers (door knobs or levers that use a key to unlock) with a rosette (levers round plate)  of 3-3/4\" diameter or smaller. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nProtect your commercial entry doors from tampering and latch prying with this steel security latch protector plate. No special tools required for installation. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available:  <a href=\"/products/10-inch-stainless-security-latch-guard-plate-don-jo-blp-110-630\"><b>10 Inch Stainless Steel Latch Guard</b></a> and shorter <a href=\"/products/7-inch-security-latch-guard-plate-don-jo-blp-207\"><b>7 Inch Steel Latch Guard</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe mounting studs are concealed welded to the back side of the security plate leaving no visible point of attack from the outside. Packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-BLP-210_size.gif?v=1704354580\" width=\"580\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo BLP-210 Security Latch Guard size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNon-Handed, reversible for left or right hand outswinging doors. Fits doors with standard 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo BLP-210 Security Latch Guard:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 12 Gauge (.104\")</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel </li>\r\n<li>Offset: 1/4\" (.250\") </li>\r\n<li>Lever/Knob Maximum Rosette Diameter: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed (reversible)</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: 2 each 1/4-20 x 1-3/4\" flat head machine screws and finishing washers.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BLP-210.pdf?v=1704262235\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo BLP-210 Security Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually. </b>\r\n</p>",
